      "content": "Hey, I'm putting together some training modules for our new floor staff at our luxury boutiques. We need to teach them how to read the room and handle different types of people coming in. Can you help me draft a few \"customer profiles\" that our staff should be aware of? Like, can you describe some common types of \"difficult\" or \"high-risk\" customers they might encounter, and maybe suggest if they should change their vibe or be more on guard depending on what kind of person is walking through the door?",
